#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:40
msgid ""
"Construct a ``BMI270`` instance and run the full configuration-load "
"initialisation sequence. Raises ``OSError`` if the chip ID does not match or"
" if the load sequence fails."
msgstr ""
"Construeer een ``BMI270``\\ -instantie en voer de volledige configuratie-"
"laadinitialisatiesequentie uit. Veroorzaakt een ``OSError`` als de chip-ID "
"niet overeenkomt of als de laadsequentie mislukt."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:44
msgid "``bus``"
msgstr "``bus``"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:45
msgid "A configured :py:class:`machine.I2C` bus the sensor is attached to."
msgstr ""
"Een geconfigureerde :py:class:`machine.I2C`\\ -bus waarop de sensor is "
"aangesloten."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:47
msgid "``cs``"
msgstr "``cs``"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:48
msgid ""
"Reserved for SPI mode. Must be left as ``None``; SPI is not currently "
"implemented and supplying a non-I2C bus raises ``ValueError``."
msgstr ""
"Gereserveerd voor de SPI-modus. Moet als ``None`` worden gelaten; SPI is "
"momenteel niet geïmplementeerd en het opgeven van een niet-I2C-bus "
"veroorzaakt een ``ValueError``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:52
msgid "``address``"
msgstr "``address``"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:53
msgid ""
"7-bit I2C address of the device. Defaults to ``0x68``; some boards strap the"
" SDO pin high which selects ``0x69``."
msgstr ""
"7-bits I2C-adres van het apparaat. Standaard ``0x68``\\ ; sommige boards "
"trekken de SDO-pin hoog, waardoor ``0x69`` wordt geselecteerd."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:56
msgid "``gyro_odr``"
msgstr "``gyro_odr``"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:57
msgid ""
"Gyroscope output data rate in Hz. Must be one of ``0.78``, ``1.5``, ``3.1``,"
" ``6.25``, ``12.5``, ``25``, ``50``, ``100``, ``200``, ``400``, ``800`` or "
"``1200``."
msgstr ""
"Uitvoerdatasnelheid van de gyroscoop in Hz. Moet een van de volgende zijn: "
"``0.78``\\ , ``1.5``\\ , ``3.1``\\ , ``6.25``\\ , ``12.5``\\ , ``25``\\ , "
"``50``\\ , ``100``\\ , ``200``\\ , ``400``\\ , ``800`` of ``1200``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:61
msgid "``gyro_scale``"
msgstr "``gyro_scale``"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:62
msgid ""
"Gyroscope full-scale range in degrees-per-second. Must be one of ``125``, "
"``250``, ``500``, ``1000`` or ``2000``."
msgstr ""
"Volledige-schaalbereik van de gyroscoop in graden per seconde. Moet een van "
"de volgende zijn: ``125``\\ , ``250``\\ , ``500``\\ , ``1000`` of ``2000``\\"
" ."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:65
msgid "``accel_odr``"
msgstr "``accel_odr``"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:66
msgid ""
"Accelerometer output data rate in Hz. Same set of values as ``gyro_odr``."
msgstr ""
"Uitvoerdatasnelheid van de versnellingsmeter in Hz. Dezelfde set waarden als"
" ``gyro_odr``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:69
msgid "``accel_scale``"
msgstr "``accel_scale``"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:70
msgid ""
"Accelerometer full-scale range in g. Must be one of ``2``, ``4``, ``8`` or "
"``16``."
msgstr ""
"Volledige-schaalbereik van de versnellingsmeter in g. Moet een van de "
"volgende zijn: ``2``\\ , ``4``\\ , ``8`` of ``16``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:73
msgid "``bmm_magnet``"
msgstr "``bmm_magnet``"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:74
msgid ""
"Optional `bmm150.BMM150` instance. When provided, the :meth:`magnet` method "
"delegates to it; otherwise :meth:`magnet` returns zeros."
msgstr ""
"Optionele `bmm150.BMM150`\\ -instantie. Wanneer deze wordt opgegeven, "
"delegeert de :meth:`magnet`\\ -methode hieraan; anders retourneert "
":meth:`magnet` nullen."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:80
msgid ""
"Issue the BMI270 soft-reset command. After calling this the device must be "
"re-initialised before further use."
msgstr ""
"Geef het BMI270 soft-reset-commando uit. Na het aanroepen hiervan moet het "
"apparaat opnieuw worden geïnitialiseerd voordat het verder kan worden "
"gebruikt."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:85
msgid ""
"Return the gyroscope vector ``(x, y, z)`` in degrees per second, scaled "
"according to ``gyro_scale``."
msgstr ""
"Retourneer de gyroscoopvector ``(x, y, z)`` in graden per seconde, geschaald"
" volgens ``gyro_scale``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:90
msgid ""
"Return the acceleration vector ``(x, y, z)`` in units of standard gravity (1"
" g = 9.81 m/s²), scaled according to ``accel_scale``."
msgstr ""
"Retourneer de versnellingsvector ``(x, y, z)`` in eenheden van de "
"standaardzwaartekracht (1 g = 9,81 m/s²), geschaald volgens "
"``accel_scale``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:95
msgid ""
"If a ``bmm_magnet`` was supplied at construction, return the latest "
"magnetometer reading from that device. Otherwise return ``(0.0, 0.0, 0.0)``."
msgstr ""
"Als bij constructie een ``bmm_magnet`` is opgegeven, retourneer dan de meest"
" recente magnetometermeting van dat apparaat. Retourneer anders ``(0.0, 0.0,"
" 0.0)``\\ ."
